{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/159a3a7a0b8e0d221a92ca19d56a5b34.avif?t=1772396899\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras_big/159a3a7a0b8e0d221a92ca19d56a5b34.avif?t=1772396899 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE SWARM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Alliance</strong> is a top-down <strong>Action Roguelite</strong> where every run is a new experiment\u2014and every level-up is a real decision. Fight through escalating waves, shape your build through upgrades and Synergies, and earn your progress across a story-driven campaign that rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth didn\u2019t just fall\u2014it turned desperate. As forests vanished and survival collapsed, humans engineered bugs to last longer\u2026 then escalated into cruelty: breeding, reshaping, and enslaving entire species as food, tools, and weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarms mutated, fought back, and forced humanity from the planet\u2014yet not all of them died. A remnant fled, watching from afar. In the silence that followed, three Queens rose to unite the surface and form <strong>Volucris</strong>\u2014while far beneath, the leftovers of human experiments continued to evolve into something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down <strong>Action Roguelite</strong> built around wave survival and buildcraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic <strong>bug characters</strong> with unique abilities and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-wave maps</strong> with boss finales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13-map story campaign</strong> revealed through higher difficulty clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>build creation</strong> via upgrades, Tactical Gear, glyphs, and <strong>Synergies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Surge</strong> endless mode with bosses, curse choices, merchants, and <strong>risky rewards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent progression: ranks, unlockable bugs, skins, challenges, tasks, and lore<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BUG. DEFINE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a growing roster of bug warriors\u2014each built around a distinct combat identity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bug has <strong>2 weapons</strong> and <strong>4 abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before a run, choose <strong>1 weapon</strong> and <strong>1 ability</strong> to level up during the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, you may gain <strong>one additional random ability</strong>, opening new combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>Pruver -</strong>\u00a0a genius engineer, then unlock more bugs by completing specific conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character supports multiple build paths\u2014from raw damage and critical bursts to sustain, defense, and control\u2014depending on how you upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONSLAUGHT: THE CORE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onslaught is the heart of Bug Alliance\u2014a focused, replayable wave experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 waves per map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A climactic <strong>boss fight at Wave 20</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to complete the map and progress to tougher challenges </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Alliance\u2019s campaign is structured as <strong>Prologue + 13 Chapters</strong>, delivered through <strong>13 maps</strong>\u2014and the story is earned through mastery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a map on <strong>Normal</strong> to unlock <strong>Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat that map on <strong>Hard</strong> to reveal its story chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard difficulty also introduces <strong>quick quests</strong>, such as defending objectives or hunting  elite enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>Hard</strong> to unlock <strong>Extreme</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme adds additional threats, including <strong>environmental events</strong> like tornadoes, meteor showers, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Extreme to unlock that map\u2019s endless variant\u2026  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS SURGE: ENDLESS RUNS, CURSES, AND HIGH-RISK REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Surge</strong> is an endless mode where the game keeps raising the stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Chaos Level</strong> rises as you kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it fills, a <strong>boss appears</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to choose one<strong>\u00a0of 3 Curse Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses are negative modifiers that reshape your run and escalate difficulty</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Merchant</strong> appears at key milestones</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>Teeth</strong> dropped by enemies to buy power-ups, healing, and other run-saving tools</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the more your build is tested\u2014and the more legendary it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL-UP CARDS: YOUR BUILD IS YOUR POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is shaped by choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you level up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 random upgrade cards</strong> appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one to strengthen your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can enhance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glyphs\u00a0</strong>(HP, shield, armor, crit, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has a <strong>max level</strong>, so committing to one path means sacrificing another\u2014making every run feel personal and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNERGIES: THE MOMENT YOUR BUILD \u201cCLICKS\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your gear to its peak and unlock <strong>Synergies</strong>\u2014powerful transformations that change how your weapons and abilities behave.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Synergy paths for every weapon and ability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path supports a different playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies turn strong builds into signature builds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the number of combinations across upgrades, stats, tactical gear, and Synergies, every character supports thousands of viable build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION, UNLOCKS, AND REPLAY GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Alliance rewards every run\u2014win or lose.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal 13-chapter breathtaking story of Bug Alliance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, abilities, and characters gain <strong>Rank</strong> the more you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking up improves performance and unlocks <strong>skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional bug characters by meeting gameplay conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Challenges</strong> (achievement-style goals) and <strong>Tasks</strong> (extra objectives during runs) for more rewards and long-term goals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE BOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the world behind the war.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal campaign story chapters by clearing maps on <strong>Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock character lore entries by meeting their unique conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more to be decided together with our great community</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018360?t=1772396899","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/005c0311127aece481ed7d7d96b6669f3c19f30e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772396899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/4b14802a6cefd203bbfbd1b30a92d0f49c2e0d93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772396899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/4b14802a6cefd203bbfbd1b30a92d0f49c2e0d93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772396899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3018590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/159a3a7a0b8e0d221a92ca19d56a5b34.avif?t=1772396899\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras_big/159a3a7a0b8e0d221a92ca19d56a5b34.avif?t=1772396899 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE SWARM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Alliance</strong> is a top-down <strong>Action Roguelite</strong> where every run is a new experiment\u2014and every level-up is a real decision. Fight through escalating waves, shape your build through upgrades and Synergies, and earn your progress across a story-driven campaign that rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/a4d8474b2d4215504d52f5093681a7d2.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth didn\u2019t just fall\u2014it turned desperate. As forests vanished and survival collapsed, humans engineered bugs to last longer\u2026 then escalated into cruelty: breeding, reshaping, and enslaving entire species as food, tools, and weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarms mutated, fought back, and forced humanity from the planet\u2014yet not all of them died. A remnant fled, watching from afar. In the silence that followed, three Queens rose to unite the surface and form <strong>Volucris</strong>\u2014while far beneath, the leftovers of human experiments continued to evolve into something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down <strong>Action Roguelite</strong> built around wave survival and buildcraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic <strong>bug characters</strong> with unique abilities and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-wave maps</strong> with boss finales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13-map story campaign</strong> revealed through higher difficulty clears</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>build creation</strong> via upgrades, Tactical Gear, glyphs, and <strong>Synergies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Surge</strong> endless mode with bosses, curse choices, merchants, and <strong>risky rewards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent progression: ranks, unlockable bugs, skins, challenges, tasks, and lore<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BUG. DEFINE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a growing roster of bug warriors\u2014each built around a distinct combat identity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bug has <strong>2 weapons</strong> and <strong>4 abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before a run, choose <strong>1 weapon</strong> and <strong>1 ability</strong> to level up during the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, you may gain <strong>one additional random ability</strong>, opening new combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>Pruver -</strong>\u00a0a genius engineer, then unlock more bugs by completing specific conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character supports multiple build paths\u2014from raw damage and critical bursts to sustain, defense, and control\u2014depending on how you upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/51f64c13c8c5481034c282556a7c8323.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONSLAUGHT: THE CORE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onslaught is the heart of Bug Alliance\u2014a focused, replayable wave experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 waves per map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A climactic <strong>boss fight at Wave 20</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to complete the map and progress to tougher challenges </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/f4ac6f217ebcd7f416a675d5d5d1a40c.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Alliance\u2019s campaign is structured as <strong>Prologue + 13 Chapters</strong>, delivered through <strong>13 maps</strong>\u2014and the story is earned through mastery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear a map on <strong>Normal</strong> to unlock <strong>Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat that map on <strong>Hard</strong> to reveal its story chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard difficulty also introduces <strong>quick quests</strong>, such as defending objectives or hunting  elite enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>Hard</strong> to unlock <strong>Extreme</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme adds additional threats, including <strong>environmental events</strong> like tornadoes, meteor showers, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Extreme to unlock that map\u2019s endless variant\u2026  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/9aefc47341a1ae16c78707b2aa1af66a.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS SURGE: ENDLESS RUNS, CURSES, AND HIGH-RISK REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Surge</strong> is an endless mode where the game keeps raising the stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Chaos Level</strong> rises as you kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it fills, a <strong>boss appears</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to choose one<strong>\u00a0of 3 Curse Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses are negative modifiers that reshape your run and escalate difficulty</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Merchant</strong> appears at key milestones</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>Teeth</strong> dropped by enemies to buy power-ups, healing, and other run-saving tools</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the more your build is tested\u2014and the more legendary it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL-UP CARDS: YOUR BUILD IS YOUR POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is shaped by choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you level up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 random upgrade cards</strong> appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one to strengthen your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can enhance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glyphs\u00a0</strong>(HP, shield, armor, crit, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has a <strong>max level</strong>, so committing to one path means sacrificing another\u2014making every run feel personal and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNERGIES: THE MOMENT YOUR BUILD \u201cCLICKS\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your gear to its peak and unlock <strong>Synergies</strong>\u2014powerful transformations that change how your weapons and abilities behave.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Synergy paths for every weapon and ability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path supports a different playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies turn strong builds into signature builds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the number of combinations across upgrades, stats, tactical gear, and Synergies, every character supports thousands of viable build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bbace2f40fa8383c3f3d162a030da39c.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION, UNLOCKS, AND REPLAY GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Alliance rewards every run\u2014win or lose.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal 13-chapter breathtaking story of Bug Alliance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, abilities, and characters gain <strong>Rank</strong> the more you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking up improves performance and unlocks <strong>skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional bug characters by meeting gameplay conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Challenges</strong> (achievement-style goals) and <strong>Tasks</strong> (extra objectives during runs) for more rewards and long-term goals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE BOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the world behind the war.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal campaign story chapters by clearing maps on <strong>Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock character lore entries by meeting their unique conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.poster.avif?t=1772396899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.webm?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.mp4?t=1772396899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more to be decided together with our great community</p>","developers":["Ent-Re Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/fb583a32d10f88f124185146c250b953aa790027/header.jpg?t=1772396899","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ent-Re Games | All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018360/1853966234/3933ab367356ec73b51857335e63df6697ed500e/1772396001/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772396898","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018360/1853966234/3933ab367356ec73b51857335e63df6697ed500e/1772396001/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772396898","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018360/1853966234/3933ab367356ec73b51857335e63df6697ed500e/1772396001/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772396898","id":257296399,"name":"Bug Alliance Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257296399/280928668f56c699b1409ed31a088ae013544a61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772396898"}],"name":"Bug Alliance","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stro