24cbdb332b66fb9d73ac9e488906e74e.600x338.jpg?t=1772396899"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/85bee8642deb622d6bd1044e8398da1b87ce1298/ss_85bee8642deb622d6bd1044e8398da1b87ce1298.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772396899","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/85bee8642deb622d6bd1044e8398da1b87ce1298/ss_85bee8642deb622d6bd1044e8398da1b87ce1298.600x338.jpg?t=1772396899"}],"short_description":"Bug Alliance is a top-down Action Roguelite where every level-up reshapes your build. Trigger Synergies, conquer 20-wave maps with boss finales, unlock a 13-chapter story on higher difficulties\u2014then dive into Chaos Surge with endless bosses, curses, and risky rewards.","steam_appid":3018360,"support_info":{"email":"entregamesstudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}